cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research or teaching, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

title: "DonatJS LMS: Minimalist Client-Side Router & UI Engine for Web Programming Courses"
abstract: >
  A zero-dependency, no-build-step, JSON-driven micro-framework for rendering structured data
  as dynamic web interfaces entirely on the client side. Deployed as an open courseware platform
  for the Web Programming (Pemrograman Web) course at Universitas IPWIJA, Jakarta. Features an
  integrated quiz engine, certificate verifier, and 16-module structured learning system covering
  HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript ES6+, LocalStorage, Fetch API, and Single Page Application architecture.
  Framework lineage: Ktupad (2019) → BayamJS (2023) → DonatJS (2024–2026).

